& [IR7BoundedOperationsDryRunImplementationActivationBoundaryV1] is the IR7-IA01 activation boundary for future bounded operations dry-run simulator implementation work
  + [activation_boundary_id] is ir7-bounded-operations-dry-run-implementation-activation-boundary-v1
