  + [boundary_status] is accepted_by_completion_review_pending
  + [model_route_used] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [implementation_scope] is activation boundary and dependency decision only

  = must: confirm future file inventory, fixture inventory, expected-ledger inventory, generated-output boundary, dependency boundary, adapter boundary, live-control deferral boundary, command plan, and proof gate for implementation slices
  = must: preserve accepted IR7 operation request, dry-run result, refusal, resource safety, human approval, fixture, generated-output, dispatch, credential, network, operation safety, and no-live-control semantics without implementation code creation in this slice
  = must: keep package dependency changes, adapters, transports, UI, live-control APIs, process control, GPU control, model runtime control, job dispatch, credential access, network mutation, destructive filesystem actions, and dispatch gated until IR7-IA07 or a later dependency-authorizing slice
  - never: create operations implementation code, fixture source files, expected ledgers, generated projections, generated reports, tests, dependencies, adapter transports, UI, process control, GPU control, model runtime control, job dispatch, credential access, network mutation, destructive filesystem action, operations control, or live machine control in this slice

